sequenceDiagram
    actor Monitor as Community monitor
    participant UI as Alerts dashboard
    participant API as Nuxt incidents API
    participant Warehouse as Warehouse DB
    participant Config as Configuration DB

    Monitor->>UI: Select alerts / observations; describe incident
    UI->>API: POST /api/incidents (entries + parent_alerts_table)
    API->>API: Member guard; session attribution; validate name
    API->>Config: BEGIN transaction
    API->>Config: INSERT collection + incident metadata
    loop Each selected entry
        API->>Warehouse: Read source row by source table / id
        Warehouse-->>API: Source data (or no row)
        API->>Config: INSERT entry + source_data snapshot
    end
    Note over Warehouse,Config: Only configuration writes share a transaction; warehouse reads are separate
    API->>Config: COMMIT (or roll back configuration writes on failure)
    API-->>UI: Created incident id
    UI->>API: GET /api/incidents?parent_alerts_table=...
    API->>Config: List incidents for current view
    Config-->>UI: Saved incidents (via API)
    UI-->>Monitor: Clear selection after successful creation

    Monitor->>UI: Open saved incident / follow incidentId link
    UI->>API: GET /api/incidents/:id (normal auth still applies)
    API->>Config: Read collection + incident + saved entries
    Config-->>API: Stored details and snapshots
    API-->>UI: Incident details + entries
    UI->>UI: Set incidentId; highlight entries; fit bounds
    UI-->>Monitor: Same incident and evidence in view
    Monitor->>UI: Download metadata / features
    UI-->>Monitor: CSV / GeoJSON generated from loaded payload
